public import Mathlib.Data.List.Basic

/-!
# Data of the torus-A residual chain (part 2)

Salted packed rows (`Design/DommaschkKamCResKron`, `RowR = (lo, cnt, F, x)`: the entries
`lo, …, lo + cnt − 1` of row `j` as fields of width `F` with offset `2^{F−1}`, above a
random `64`-bit salt) of the centres of the high-resolution ball chain of Dommaschk torus A
(`Design/DommaschkKamAResEnv`; layout `N × M = 96 × 80`, scale `2^{−128}`). Generated by
the untrusted oracle `scripts/dommaschk_kam/emit_res.py`; nothing here is trusted.
-/

@[expose] public section

namespace PlasmaLean.Design.DommaschkKamA

